#let profile-summary = [
  Hello, there! I am Hongwei Cai, a postdoctoral fellow in the Department of Intelligent Systems Engineering at Indiana University Bloomington. 
  
  My research develops intelligent biomedical systems at the intersection of human organoids, microfluidics, bioelectronics, sensors, and artificial intelligence, toward translational precision medicine and sustainable biohybrid computing.

  My work has been published in journals such as _Nature Electronics_, _Cell Stem Cell_, _Nature Communications_, _PNAS_, _Bioactive Materials_, _Biofabrication_, _Lab on a Chip_, etc.

  I earned my Ph.D. in Intelligent Systems Engineering from Indiana University Bloomington in 2025, under the mentorship of Prof. Feng Guo. I also hold a B.S. from Nanjing University.
]

